```

### Summary
This implementation adheres to the security guidelines provided. It sanitizes user input to prevent XSS attacks, uses proper MIME types for responses, and handles error messages appropriately. The logging functionality is simple and stores logs in a text file, ensuring that each log message is on a new line.
